*...+....1....+....2....+....3....+....4....+....5....+....6....+....7....+....8
TITLE
Pion fluence and boundary current in a three-slab beryllium target
DEFAULTS                                                              HADROTHE
*
BEAM      -3.000E-01                                                  PION+
BEAMPOS          0.0       0.0      -9.0
*
GEOBEGIN                                                              COMBNAME
    0    0
RPP world      -100.0 +100.0 -100.0 +100.0 -100.0 +100.0
RPP vacbox      -50.0  +50.0  -50.0  +50.0  -50.0  +50.0
RPP airbox      -10.0  +10.0  -10.0  +10.0  -10.0  +20.0
RPP boxup       -10.0  +10.0  -10.0  +10.0  -10.0   +0.0
RPP boxmid      -10.0  +10.0  -10.0  +10.0   +0.0   +9.0
RPP boxdn       -10.0  +10.0  -10.0  +10.0   +9.0  +20.0
RPP slab1        -1.0   +1.0   -1.0   +1.0    0.0   +3.0
RPP slab2        -1.0   +1.0   -1.0   +1.0    3.0   +6.0
RPP slab3        -1.0   +1.0   -1.0   +1.0    6.0   +9.0
END
regBH        5 +world -vacbox
regVAC       5 +vacbox -airbox
regAUP       5 +boxup
regAIR       5 +boxmid -slab1 -slab2 -slab3
regADN       5 +boxdn
regUP        5 +slab1
regMID       5 +slab2
regDWN       5 +slab3
END
GEOEND
*
ASSIGNMA    BLCKHOLE     regBH
ASSIGNMA      VACUUM    regVAC
ASSIGNMA         AIR    regAUP
ASSIGNMA         AIR    regAIR
ASSIGNMA         AIR    regADN
ASSIGNMA    BERYLLIU     regUP
ASSIGNMA    BERYLLIU    regMID
ASSIGNMA    BERYLLIU    regDWN
*
* Pion fluence in the three slabs and in the surrounding air region
USRTRACK        -1.0    PION+     -30.0     regUP       0.0     120.0 FLUUP
USRTRACK        0.12    1.0E-6     120.0                              &
USRTRACK        -1.0    PION+     -31.0    regMID       0.0     120.0 FLUMID
USRTRACK        0.12    1.0E-6     120.0                              &
USRTRACK        -1.0    PION+     -32.0    regDWN       0.0     120.0 FLUDWN
USRTRACK        0.12    1.0E-6     120.0                              &
USRTRACK        -1.0    PION+     -33.0    regAIR       0.0     120.0 FLUAIR
USRTRACK        0.12    1.0E-6     120.0                              &
*
* Pion boundary current at entrance, slab interfaces, and exit
USRBDX          16.0    PION+     -34.0    regAUP     regUP       0.0 BDXENT
USRBDX          0.12    1.0E-6     120.0                              &
USRBDX          16.0    PION+     -35.0     regUP    regMID       0.0 BDX12
USRBDX          0.12    1.0E-6     120.0                              &
USRBDX          16.0    PION+     -36.0    regMID    regDWN       0.0 BDX23
USRBDX          0.12    1.0E-6     120.0                              &
USRBDX          16.0    PION+     -37.0    regDWN    regADN       0.0 BDXEXT
USRBDX          0.12    1.0E-6     120.0                              &
*
RANDOMIZ         1.0    145789
START         200000
STOP
